and account reads from a futures brokerage gateway, and it can place, modify and
cancel orders and close positions on a practice account when trading is
explicitly enabled. That switch defaults to off. Use at your own risk. Nothing
here is financial advice. Anyone running it is solely responsible for their own
trading decisions, outcomes, and losses, and for complying with their broker's
and prop firm's terms. Its risk is also in what it reports, because a figure
that is subtly wrong looks exactly like one that is right and is acted on by
whoever reads it. It is provided on an "AS IS" BASIS, WITHOUT WARRANTIES OR
CONDITIONS OF ANY KIND.

